  "description": "One error-model vocabulary for the Orion family: a zero-alloc Result<T> struct, Option<T>, and a structured Error (code + kind + field errors) so expected failures flow as data, not as exceptions. Map/Bind/Match/Ensure railway composition, implicit conversions, and the family's IOrionResult contract. AOT- and trim-clean.",
